    "media:imagetext": "NOW! NON-STOP AIRLINE SERVICE\nPITTSFIELD - BOSTON\nONE HOUR EITHER WAY\nPittsfield people asked us for more airline service—non-stop flights to Boston-round trip service in one day with time for\nbusiness or shopping in the Hub City. Starting July 25 you get all three—plus two flights daily to Albany and local service to West-\nfield and Worcester. Make reservations early by calling Wiggins Airways at Pittsfield Airport-Pittsfield 9823.\nTEAR\nOUT - USE FOR POCKET TIME TABLE\nWE NOW OFFER YOU:\nNON-STOP ONE-HOUR\nSERVICE BETWEEN\nPITTSFIELD AND BOSTON\nONE-DAY ROUND TRIP\nSERVICE TO BOSTON WITH\n8 HOURS IN THE HUB\nALBANY FLIGHTS\nTWICE DAILY\nLOCAL SERVICE TO\nWESTFIELD AND\nWORCESTER\nCONNECTIONS AT ALBANY\nAND BOSTON FOR NEW YORK,\nCAPE COD, NORTHERN NEW\nENGLAND, CANADA AND POINTS\nSOUTH AND WEST\nAIR FLIGHTS\nDAILY AND SUNDAY\nEQUIPMENT\nWiggins Airways TWIN ENGINE CESSNAS\nNEW ENGLAND'S COMMUNITY AIRLINE\nPITTSFIELD SERVICE\nEffective July 25, 1950\nEASTBOUND FLIGHTS\nAlbany - Pittsfield - Boston\nFLIGHT 232 (non-stop)\nLeave ALBANY\nLeave NO. ADAMS\nLeave PITTSFIELD\nArrive BOSTON\n6:55 am\n7:22 am\n7:41 am\n8:41 am\nFLIGHT 34 (Local)\nleave ALBANY\nLeave PITTSFIELD\nLeave WESTFIELD\nLeave WORCESTER\nArrive BOSTON\n1:40 pm\n2:07 pm\n2:38 pm\n3:09 pm\n3:37 pm\nEastern Standard Time — Add One Hour for Daylight Saving\nFLIGHT 31 (Local)\nLeave BOSTON\nLeave WORCESTER\nLeave WESTFIELD\nLeave PITTSFIELD\nArrive ALBANY\nWESTBOUND FLIGHTS\nBoston - Pittsfield - Albany\nFLIGHT 231 (Non-stop)\n7:40 am\n8:18 am\n8:53 am\n9:22 am\n9:45 am\nLeave BOSTON\nLeave\nPITTSFIELD\nLeave NO. ADAMS\nArrive ALBANY ...\n4:40 pm\n5:49 pm\n6:10 pm\n6:33 pm\nEastern Standard Time — Add One Hour for Daylight Saving\nALL SCHEDULES SUBJECT TO CHANGE WITHOUT NOTICE",
